\U+201CWe need an interior stair case to the bridge as well.\U+201D A straight flight, 0.8 m clear, 13 risers of 0.2 m at 45\U+00B0, in a trunk on the saloon\U+2019s starboard side behind a door marked \U+4E57\U+7D44\U+54E1\U+5C02\U+7528 (crew only); its well rises through the master\U+2019s cabin\U+2019s corner, walled off, into the wheelhouse\U+2019s aft starboard corner, railed,
0
