\U+201CThe accommodation needs to be more cosy and comfortable, it should be fun to sit there and do nothing.\U+201D 34 reclining seats in terracotta moquette, 0.7 m a place, wooden arms, white head covers, five rows at 0.88 m facing the bow (finding 6), a 0.9 m aisle; a rose-brown carpet, cream curtains tied back at the side
0
